WSL has no /sys/class/dmi/id/sys_vendor, so get_manufacturer() returns
None. The Intune details() API requires a non-empty Manufacturer field,
rejecting requests with 400 Bad Request otherwise.

Provide "Microsoft Corporation" as the fallback since the device runs on
a Microsoft hypervisor.

--- a/src/discovery.rs
+++ b/src/discovery.rs
@@ -350,7 +350,7 @@
             os_version: os_version_int,
             target_domain,
             os_distribution,
-            manufacturer: get_manufacturer().unwrap_or_default(),
+            manufacturer: get_manufacturer().unwrap_or_else(|| "Microsoft Corporation".to_string()),
         })
     }
 }
